# loader Worker local-dev secrets (loader/.dev.vars).
# Copy to `.dev.vars` and fill in. This file is gitignored; the example is tracked.
# Deploy the secret once with: cd loader && npx wrangler secret put LOADER_TOKEN
#
# LOADER_TOKEN protects the loader Worker /run endpoint (POST only).
# Pipeline URL vars (PIPELINE_RUNS_URL / CONTRACTS / UNDERLYINGS / ERRORS) are
# non-secret and already set in loader/wrangler.jsonc — they do NOT belong here.

LOADER_TOKEN=
